{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"1d9558e67f6208a169ce6acd04bdf141a6935ce62d0392cd8c1dc20cca32b880","digest":{"component_or_area":"test design standards and guardrails","key_entities":["examples/agent-skills/shared/test-design.md","examples/agent-skills/rebar-debug/test-design.md","examples/agent-skills/rebar-implement/test-design.md","examples/agent-skills/rebar-brainstorm/test-design.md","tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_outbound_comment_length_convergence.py","tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/diffing/test_comment_dedup_key_matches_send_fit.py","tests/unit/test_skill_shared_sync.py","acli_cli_ops.add_comment","comment_limits.truncate_comment_body","AdfCodec.fit_outbound","fit_preserving_marker"],"problem_keywords":["convergence test","test oracle","re-derived assertion","external effect","test design","send path","stale model"],"propositions":["Convergence tests that re-derive the external-effect side using the same helpers as the call site under test remain green when the send path drifts, defeating the convergence check's purpose","The correct oracle shape for convergence tests is to drive the real production entry point with only the irreducible boundary stubbed and capture what it handed the boundary, not to recompose helpers from the call site","The rule distinguishing defective (re-derived) from sanctioned (captured) convergence oracles is intent-based (whether a side represents an external effect), not syntactically detectable, making mechanical enforcement infeasible without unacceptable false positives","Documentation of the capture-don't-re-derive rule must be recorded in the shared test-design standard with worked examples, discoverable by test authors at oracle-design time"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787762401333851001,"uuid":"b1714bd7-038e-4796-9352-11e94378324a"}